             897     4   p    v                    dz1 = zo(i,k) - zo(i,k-1)
             898     4   p    v                    gamma = el2orc * qeso(i,k-1) / (to(i,k-1)**2)
             899     4   p    v                    rfact =  1. + delta * cp * gamma * to(i,k-1) / hvap
