            1160     4                             - (aup * eta(i,k-1) - adw * edto(i) * etad(i,k-1))* dv3   &
            1161     4                                         - aup * deta * dv2                            &
            1162     4                                         + adw * edto(i) * detad * hcdo(i)) * g / dp
