            1231                     !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
            1232                     !
            1233                     !--- the above changed environment is now used to calulate the
            1234                     !--- effect the arbitrary cloud (with unit mass flux)
            1235                     !--- would have on the stability,
            1236                     !--- which then is used to calculate the real mass flux,
            1237                     !--- necessary to keep this change in balance with the large-scale
            1238                     !--- destabilization.
            1239                     !
