            1776     5   p    v                      delq2(i) = delqev(i) + .001 * qevap(i) * dp / g
            1777     5   p    v                    endif
            1778     5   p    v                    if(rn(i).gt.0..and.qcond(i).lt.0. .and. delq2(i).gt.rntot(i)) then
